One important change I recommend
Don't give an AI coding agent all of these documents and immediately tell it "build everything."
Use them as a controlled specification:
STEP 1
Read all documents.
Do not modify code.
Identify contradictions, missing information and implementation risks.

STEP 2
Create the technical implementation plan.

STEP 3
Implement the foundation and design system.

STEP 4
Implement the public website.

STEP 5
Implement authentication.

STEP 6
Implement Help Center.

STEP 7
Implement Support.

STEP 8
Implement Community.

STEP 9
Implement Feature Requests and Bug Reports.

STEP 10
Implement AI Help Assistant.

STEP 11
Implement Admin Panel.

STEP 12
Run complete testing and compare the implementation against /docs.